<template>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="head"><div><h2>申论练习</h2><p>依据历年国考真题和教材规则，从已采集评估的人民日报文章生成练习草稿；审核通过后再发布。</p></div><el-button v-if="canWrite && activeTab==='exercises'" type="primary" @click="edit()">新建练习</el-button></header>
    <el-alert title="质量边界：真题和教材用于约束设问与评价标准，人民日报仅作练习材料。证据须能逐字回查；自动生成结果只进入待审核草稿，不会自动发布。" type="info" :closable="false" />
    <el-tabs v-model="activeTab" class="work-tabs">
      <el-tab-pane label="题目管理" name="exercises">
    <div class="filters"><el-input v-model="q" clearable placeholder="搜索题目、材料标题" @keyup.enter="load" /><el-select v-model="type" clearable placeholder="题型" @change="load"><el-option v-for="(label,key) in types" :key="key" :label="label" :value="key" /></el-select><el-select v-model="status" clearable placeholder="状态" @change="load"><el-option label="草稿" value="draft" /><el-option label="已发布" value="published" /><el-option label="已归档" value="archived" /></el-select><el-button @click="load">筛选</el-button></div>
    <el-table v-loading="loading" :data="items" stripe><el-table-column label="题目 / 来源" min-width="330"><template #default="{row}"><b>{{ row.title }}</b><div class="muted">{{ row.source_title || '未关联来源' }} · {{ row.source_date || '日期未填' }}</div></template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="题型" width="120"><template #default="{row}">{{ types[row.question_type] }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="质量" width="140"><template #default="{row}"><el-tag v-if="row.generation_job_id" :type="row.quality_report?.pass && (row.quality_score||0)>=8?'success':'warning'">{{ row.quality_report?.pass?'规则':'需复核' }} {{ row.quality_score||0 }}/10</el-tag><span v-else class="muted">人工录入</span></template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="标记" width="130"><template #default="{row}"><el-tag v-if="row.is_featured" type="warning">今日推荐</el-tag><el-tag :type="row.status==='published'?'success':row.status==='archived'?'info':'warning'">{{ statusName(row.status) }}</el-tag></template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="操作" width="180"><template #default="{row}"><el-button link @click="edit(row)">查看 / 编辑</el-button><el-button v-if="canWrite && row.status!=='archived'" link type="danger" @click="archiveRow(row)">归档</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table>
    <el-pagination v-model:current-page="page" :total="total" :page-size="20" layout="total, prev, pager, next" @current-change="load" />
      </el-tab-pane>
      <el-tab-pane label="自动出题" name="generation" lazy>
    <el-card class="auto-panel" shadow="never">
      <div class="auto-head"><div><h3>每日自动出题</h3><p>定时任务在人民日报全文评估后运行；仅选取有公共议题、治理或政策执行证据的候选，每批最多处理 3 篇。同一刊期再次运行会续跑尚未处理的候选，失败文章可重试。若上游联合分析失败，可先重跑采集再生成。</p></div><div class="auto-actions"><el-date-picker v-model="generationDate" type="date" value-format="YYYY-MM-DD" format="YYYY-MM-DD" :clearable="false" /><el-button @click="openVocabulary">重跑上游分析</el-button><el-button v-if="canWrite" type="primary" :loading="generating" @click="generateDaily">生成 / 继续下一批</el-button></div></div>
      <el-table v-if="jobsList.length" :data="jobsList.slice(0,5)" size="small" stripe>
        <el-table-column prop="issue_date" label="刊期" width="120" /><el-table-column label="触发" width="90"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.trigger_mode==='scheduled'?'定时':'手动' }}</template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="状态" width="100"><template #default="{row}"><el-tag :type="row.status==='completed'?'success':row.status==='running'?'primary':row.status==='failed'?'danger':'warning'">{{ jobStatus(row.status) }}</el-tag></template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="结果" min-width="360"><template #default="{row}">候选 {{ row.progress?.candidateArticles||0 }} 篇 · 本批 {{ row.progress?.selectedArticles||0 }} 篇 · 已处理 {{ row.progress?.processedArticles||0 }}/{{ row.progress?.selectedArticles||0 }} · 累计草稿 {{ row.progress?.generated?.length||0 }} 道 · 退回 {{ row.progress?.rejected?.length||0 }} 道 · 失败 {{ row.progress?.failures?.length||0 }} 篇<div v-if="row.status==='running'&&row.progress?.currentArticle" class="muted">当前：{{ row.progress.currentArticle }}</div><div v-else-if="row.progress?.dailyLimitReached" class="muted">已达到每日自动处理上限</div><div v-else-if="row.progress?.remainingCandidates" class="muted">待续跑 {{ row.progress.remainingCandidates }} 篇</div></template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="说明" min-width="220"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.error||'—' }}</template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column type="expand" width="44"><template #default="{row}"><div class="job-details"><b>质量退回</b><div v-if="!row.progress?.rejected?.length" class="muted">无退回项</div><div v-for="(item,index) in row.progress?.rejected||[]" :key="index" class="job-detail-row"><b>{{ item.title||'来源文章' }}</b><span v-if="item.score"> · {{ item.score }}/10</span><span> · {{ (item.errors||[]).join('；') }}</span></div><b class="job-skip-title">运行失败</b><div v-if="!row.progress?.failures?.length" class="muted">无运行失败</div><div v-for="(item,index) in row.progress?.failures||[]" :key="`failure-${index}`" class="job-detail-row"><b>{{ item.title||'批次' }}</b>：{{ (item.errors||[]).join('；') }}</div><b class="job-skip-title">材料筛选/去重</b><div v-if="!row.progress?.skipped?.length" class="muted">无跳过项</div><div v-for="(item,index) in row.progress?.skipped||[]" :key="`skip-${index}`" class="job-detail-row">{{ item.title }}：{{ item.reason }}</div></div></template></el-table-column>
      </el-table>
      <div v-else class="empty-jobs">还没有自动出题批次。每日任务依赖人民日报全文采集、AI评估和服务端 LLM 配置。</div>
    </el-card>
      </el-tab-pane>
      <el-tab-pane label="教研反馈" name="feedback" lazy>
    <el-card class="review-metrics" shadow="never" v-loading="metricsLoading">
      <div class="metrics-head"><div><h3>教研反馈汇总</h3><p>按最新审核结论统计；问题维度按审核历史累计，用于发现反复出现的质量短板。版本修改率需结合已审核样本量判断，审核样本可导出用于后续规则校准。</p></div><div class="metrics-actions"><el-button size="small" :loading="exportingDataset" @click="exportReviewDataset">导出审核样本 JSON</el-button><el-button size="small" @click="loadReviewMetrics">刷新</el-button></div></div>
      <div class="metrics-grid"><div><span>练习总量</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.total_exercises||0 }}</b></div><div><span>已审核</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.reviewed_count||0 }}</b></div><div><span>通过</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.decision_counts?.approved||0 }}</b></div><div><span>退回修改</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.decision_counts?.revision_required||0 }}</b></div><div><span>不采用</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.decision_counts?.rejected||0 }}</b></div><div><span>审核后有修改</span><b>{{ reviewMetrics?.corrections_made_count||0 }}</b></div></div>
      <div class="issue-summary"><span>高频问题维度：</span><el-tag v-for="item in topReviewIssues" :key="item[0]" size="small" type="warning">{{ reviewIssueName(item[0]) }} {{ item[1] }}</el-tag><span v-if="!topReviewIssues.length" class="muted">暂时没有标注问题，完成审核后会在这里汇总。</span></div>
      <el-table v-if="ruleVersionRows.length" :data="ruleVersionRows" size="small" class="version-table">
        <el-table-column prop="version" label="生成规则版本" min-width="200" />
        <el-table-column prop="total" label="练习数" width="90" />
        <el-table-column prop="reviewed" label="已审核" width="90" />
        <el-table-column prop="approved" label="通过" width="80" />
        <el-table-column prop="revision_required" label="退回修改" width="100" />
        <el-table-column prop="rejected" label="不采用" width="90" />
        <el-table-column label="审核后修改率" width="120"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.reviewed ? `${Math.round(row.corrections_made / row.reviewed * 100)}%` : '—' }}</template></el-table-column>
      </el-table>
    </el-card>
      </el-tab-pane>
    </el-tabs>
    <el-drawer v-model="editing" :title="draft?.id ? '编辑练习' : '新建练习'" size="760px" destroy-on-close>
      <el-form v-if="draft" label-position="top">
        <el-alert v-if="draft.generation_job_id" :title="`AI草稿 · ${draft.quality_report?.pass?'规则通过':'需要复核'} · 规则分 ${draft.quality_score||0}/10 · ${draft.generation_model||'模型信息未记录'}`" :description="(draft.quality_report?.errors||[]).join('；') || '已通过结构和证据校验；规则分不替代教研审核。'" :type="draft.quality_report?.pass && (draft.quality_score||0)>=8?'success':'warning'" :closable="false" />
        <el-alert v-if="draft.quality_report?.semantic_review" :title="`二次教研复核：${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.pass?'通过':'未通过'} · ${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.score||0}/10${draft.quality_report.benchmarkSetVersion?' · 真题结构基准 '+draft.quality_report.benchmarkSetVersion:''}${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.findings?.length?' · '+draft.quality_report.semantic_review.findings.length+'条提示':''}`" :description="(draft.quality_report.semantic_review.findings||[]).map(x=>`[${x.severity||'待分类'}${x.issue_type?'/'+x.issue_type:''}] ${x.dimension||'质量问题'}：${x.reason||''}`).concat(draft.quality_report.semantic_review.critical_issues||[],draft.quality_report.semantic_review.suggestions||[]).join('；') || '已检查任务匹配、答案逐点覆盖、材料证据、字数上限、要点归并与解析材料边界；此报告仍不能替代教研人工审核。'" :type="draft.quality_report.semantic_review.pass && !draft.quality_report.semantic_review.findings?.length?'success':'warning'" :closable="false" />
        <el-alert v-if="draft.quality_report?.taskCard" title="命题任务卡" :description="`任务焦点：${draft.quality_report.taskCard.focus||'—'}；材料情境：${draft.quality_report.taskCard.scene||'—'}；原文锚点：${draft.quality_report.taskCard.anchor||'—'}`" type="info" :closable="false" />
        <el-alert v-if="draft.quality_report?.semantic_review" title="题目具体度复核" :description="`具体对象与任务范围：${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.task_specificity?'通过':'未通过'}；依赖材料事实：${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.material_dependence?'通过':'未通过'}；考生可据材料作答：${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.candidate_answerability?'通过':'未通过'}；作答边界明确：${draft.quality_report.semantic_review.scope_bounded?'通过':'未通过'}`" :type="draft.quality_report.semantic_review.task_specificity && draft.quality_report.semantic_review.material_dependence && draft.quality_report.semantic_review.candidate_answerability && draft.quality_report.semantic_review.scope_bounded?'success':'warning'" :closable="false" />
        <el-alert title="先关联来源文章或手动填写来源信息。来源摘录需能回查，题目、答案和解析经人工核验后再发布。" type="warning" :closable="false" />
        <el-form-item v-if="draft.question_type==='essay'" label="关联已审核事实素材"><el-select v-model="draft.source_material_id" clearable filterable placeholder="仅显示已审核、8分及以上的事实素材" style="width:100%" @change="factMaterialChanged"><el-option v-for="m in factMaterialList" :key="m.id" :label="`${m.source_date} · ${m.source_title} · ${m.text}`" :value="m.id" /></el-select><div class="muted">选中后带入审核事实摘要和原文证据；学员据此练习主题归纳与论证成段。</div></el-form-item>
        <el-alert v-if="draft.source_material_id" :title="`审核事实摘要：${draft.fact_material_summary}`" :description="draft.fact_material_limit ? `使用边界：${draft.fact_material_limit}` : '事实摘要只作练习锚点；请核对原文证据和题目支撑关系。'" type="info" :closable="false" />
        <section v-if="draft.source_material_id" class="fact-training-panel">
          <div class="fact-training-head"><div><b>AI 主题训练包</b><p>生成后逐条核对主题适配、相关素材关系、引用原文和参考论证段；保存并完成教研审核后才会向学员展示。</p></div><div class="fact-training-actions"><el-button @click="refreshTrainingPreview">刷新预览</el-button><el-button v-if="canWrite" type="primary" plain :loading="generatingFactTraining" @click="generateTraining">生成 / 更新训练包</el-button></div></div>
          <el-alert v-if="draft.fact_training?.review_notice" :title="draft.fact_training.review_notice" :description="`模型：${draft.fact_training.generated_by||'未记录'} · 主题 ${draft.fact_training.themes?.length||0} 个 · 相关素材 ${draft.fact_training.related_materials?.length||0} 条`" type="warning" :closable="false" />
          <div v-for="theme in draft.fact_training?.themes||[]" :key="theme.id" class="fact-training-theme"><b>{{ theme.theme }}</b><p><strong>适配理由：</strong>{{ theme.fit_reason }}</p><p><strong>训练任务：</strong>{{ theme.task_prompt }}</p><p><strong>参考观点：</strong>{{ theme.point }}</p><p><strong>分析：</strong>{{ theme.analysis }}</p><blockquote>{{ theme.paragraph }}</blockquote><p v-for="(citation,index) in theme.citations||[]" :key="index" class="fact-training-citation">引文核验：{{ citation.exact_evidence }}</p></div>
          <div v-for="material in draft.fact_training?.related_materials||[]" :key="material.id" class="fact-training-related"><b>关联素材 · {{ material.source_title }} · {{ material.source_date }}</b><p>{{ material.text }}</p><span>关联理由：{{ material.relation_reason }}</span></div>
          <el-form-item label="训练包 JSON（可人工修订；保存时会重新校验素材与引用）"><el-input v-model="factTrainingText" type="textarea" :rows="12" spellcheck="false" /></el-form-item>
        </section>
        <el-form-item label="关联人民日报文章"><el-select v-model="draft.source_article_id" clearable filterable placeholder="选择文章（可选）" style="width:100%" @change="articleChanged"><el-option v-for="a in articleList" :key="a.id" :label="`${a.publish_date} · ${a.title}`" :value="a.id" /></el-select></el-form-item>
        <el-row :gutter="12"><el-col :span="15"><el-form-item label="练习标题"><el-input v-model="draft.title" /></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="9"><el-form-item label="题型"><el-select v-model="draft.question_type" style="width:100%" @change="questionTypeChanged"><el-option v-for="(label,key) in types" :key="key" :label="label" :value="key" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-col></el-row>
        <el-alert :title="typeGuidance[draft.question_type]" type="info" :closable="false" />
        <el-row :gutter="12"><el-col :span="14"><el-form-item label="来源标题"><el-input v-model="draft.source_title" /></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="10"><el-form-item label="来源日期"><el-input v-model="draft.source_date" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" /></el-form-item></el-col></el-row><el-form-item label="来源链接"><el-input v-model="draft.source_url" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="材料摘录（保留原文依据）"><el-input v-model="draft.source_excerpt" type="textarea" :rows="6" maxlength="12000" show-word-limit /></el-form-item>
        <section v-if="evidencePoints.length" class="evidence-preview"><h4>逐点证据回查</h4><div v-for="(point,index) in evidencePoints" :key="index" class="evidence-point"><div><b>{{ index + 1 }}. {{ point.point }}</b><el-tag size="small" :type="evidenceMatched(point.evidence)?'success':'danger'">{{ evidenceMatched(point.evidence)?'摘录中可回查':'摘录中未找到' }}</el-tag></div><blockquote>{{ point.evidence || '未填写材料证据' }}</blockquote><p v-if="draft.quality_report?.semantic_review?.point_checks?.[index]?.reason" class="relation-reason">复核依据：{{ draft.quality_report.semantic_review.point_checks[index].reason }}</p></div></section>
        <el-alert v-if="draft.quality_report?.keyPointsRationale" :title="`参考要点归并说明（${evidencePoints.length}项）`" :description="draft.quality_report.keyPointsRationale" type="info" :closable="false" />
        <section v-if="draft.quality_report?.semantic_review?.answer_point_checks?.length" class="evidence-preview"><h4>参考答案逐点覆盖回查</h4><div v-for="(check,index) in draft.quality_report.semantic_review.answer_point_checks" :key="index" class="evidence-point"><div><b>{{ evidencePoints[check.point_index]?.point || `第${check.point_index+1}项参考要点` }}</b><el-tag size="small" :type="check.covered?'success':'danger'">{{ check.covered?'答案已覆盖':'答案未覆盖' }}</el-tag></div><blockquote>{{ check.quote || '复核未提供答案引文' }}</blockquote><p v-if="check.reason" class="relation-reason">复核依据：{{ check.reason }}</p></div></section>
        <el-form-item label="题目设问"><el-input v-model="draft.prompt" type="textarea" :rows="3" /></el-form-item><el-form-item label="作答要求"><el-input v-model="draft.requirements" type="textarea" :rows="2" /></el-form-item>
        <el-row :gutter="12"><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="字数上限（0=不限）"><el-input-number v-model="draft.max_chars" :min="0" :max="5000" /></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="难度"><el-select v-model="draft.difficulty"><el-option label="基础" value="基础" /><el-option label="进阶" value="进阶" /><el-option label="提高" value="提高" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="预计用时（分钟）"><el-input-number v-model="draft.estimated_minutes" :min="1" :max="180" /></el-form-item></el-col></el-row>
        <el-form-item label="审题提示"><el-input v-model="draft.hint" type="textarea" :rows="2" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="参考要点 JSON（每项 point + evidence；每个要点均须有材料依据）"><el-input v-model="pointsText" type="textarea" :rows="6" placeholder="[{&quot;point&quot;:&quot;要点概括&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:&quot;材料原文依据&quot;}]" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="自查评价维度 JSON（至少两项 name + description）"><el-input v-model="rubricText" type="textarea" :rows="4" placeholder="[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;要点完整&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;是否覆盖材料中的关键内容&quot;}]" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="参考答案"><el-input v-model="draft.sample_answer" type="textarea" :rows="5" /></el-form-item><el-form-item label="答案解析（说明材料定位、归纳/推导逻辑、表达取舍）"><el-input v-model="draft.analysis" type="textarea" :rows="5" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="关联已有积累 JSON（可选）"><el-input v-model="assetsText" type="textarea" :rows="2" placeholder="[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quote|vocabulary|material&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;记录ID&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;名称&quot;}]" /></el-form-item>
        <el-divider content-position="left">教研审核反馈</el-divider>
        <el-alert v-if="draft.human_review_history?.length" title="历史审核记录" type="info" :closable="false"><div v-for="(review,index) in draft.human_review_history.slice(-5).reverse()" :key="index" class="review-history-row">{{ review.reviewed_at || '时间未记录' }} · {{ reviewDecisionName(review.decision) }}<span v-if="review.reviewer"> · {{ review.reviewer }}</span><span v-if="review.issue_tags?.length"> · {{ review.issue_tags.map(reviewIssueName).join('、') }}</span><span v-if="review.notes"> · {{ review.notes }}</span><span v-if="review.corrections_made"> · 已修改内容</span></div></el-alert>
        <el-row :gutter="12"><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="审核结论"><el-select v-model="draft.human_review.decision" style="width:100%" @change="reviewDecisionChanged"><el-option label="待审核" value="pending" /><el-option label="通过" value="approved" /><el-option label="退回修改" value="revision_required" /><el-option label="不采用" value="rejected" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="16"><el-form-item label="问题维度"><el-select v-model="draft.human_review.issue_tags" multiple collapse-tags style="width:100%"><el-option v-for="item in reviewIssueOptions" :key="item.value" :label="item.label" :value="item.value" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-col></el-row>
        <el-form-item label="审核意见（退回修改/不采用时必填）"><el-input v-model="draft.human_review.notes" type="textarea" :rows="3" maxlength="2000" show-word-limit /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="本次审核是否修改了题目/答案/解析"><el-switch v-model="draft.human_review.corrections_made" /></el-form-item>
        <el-row :gutter="12"><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="排序"><el-input-number v-model="draft.sort_order" /></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="今日推荐"><el-switch v-model="draft.is_featured" /></el-form-item></el-col><el-col :span="8"><el-form-item label="发布状态"><el-select v-model="draft.status"><el-option label="草稿" value="draft" /><el-option label="已发布" value="published" /><el-option label="已归档" value="archived" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-col></el-row>
        <el-button v-if="canWrite" type="primary" :loading="saving" @click="save">保存练习</el-button>
      </el-form>
    </el-drawer>
  </div>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed,onMounted,onUnmounted,ref } from 'vue'
import { ElMessage,ElMessageBox } from 'element-plus'
import { useAuthStore } from '@/stores/auth'
import { useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import * as api from '@/api/shenlunExercises'
const types:Record<string,string>={summary:'归纳概括',countermeasure:'提出对策',implementation:'贯彻执行',essay:'申发论述'}
const reviewIssueOptions=[{value:'source_fidelity',label:'材料忠实度'},{value:'task_fit',label:'题型/设问匹配'},{value:'evidence_support',label:'证据支撑'},{value:'answer_coverage',label:'答案覆盖'},{value:'analysis_quality',label:'解析教学性'},{value:'format_language',label:'格式与表达'},{value:'difficulty',label:'难度设置'},{value:'other',label:'其他'}]
const typeGuidance:Record<api.ExerciseType,string>={summary:'归纳概括：明确概括对象与字数边界；自查维度须覆盖要点完整、归纳准确。',countermeasure:'提出对策：题干应有明确问题情境；自查维度须检查针对问题与可行可操作。',implementation:'贯彻执行：题干交代身份、对象、目的或文种；作答要求明确格式与内容要素。',essay:'申发论述：优先设计为事实论证段训练。材料须有可核验事实，题目聚焦观点与论证；学员端按“找事实—定主题—提观点—做分析—成段落”逐步作答。参考答案与解析应区分原文事实和分析示例。'}
const auth=useAuthStore(),canWrite=computed(()=>auth.hasPermission('rmrb:write'))
const activeTab=ref<'exercises'|'generation'|'feedback'>('exercises')
const reviewMetrics=ref<api.ShenlunReviewMetrics>(),metricsLoading=ref(false),exportingDataset=ref(false)
const topReviewIssues=computed(()=>Object.entries(reviewMetrics.value?.issue_counts||{}).slice(0,5))
const ruleVersionRows=computed(()=>Object.entries(reviewMetrics.value?.by_rule_version||{}).map(([version,counts])=>({version,...counts})).sort((a,b)=>b.reviewed-a.reviewed||a.version.localeCompare(b.version)))
const router=useRouter()
const items=ref<api.ShenlunExercise[]>([]),articleList=ref<Awaited<ReturnType<typeof api.articles>>>([]),q=ref(''),type=ref(''),status=ref(''),page=ref(1),total=ref(0),loading=ref(false),editing=ref(false),saving=ref(false),draft=ref<api.ShenlunExercise>()
const factMaterialList=ref<api.ShenlunFactMaterial[]>([]),generatingFactTraining=ref(false)
const jobsList=ref<api.ShenlunExerciseJob[]>([]),generating=ref(false),pollTimer=ref<ReturnType<typeof setInterval>|null>(null)
function localToday(){const d=new Date();return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`}
const generationDate=ref(localToday())
const pointsText=ref('[]'),rubricText=ref('[]'),assetsText=ref('[]'),factTrainingText=ref('{}')
const evidencePoints=computed(()=>{try{const parsed=JSON.parse(pointsText.value);return Array.isArray(parsed)?parsed.filter(x=>x&&typeof x==='object'):[]}catch{return []}})
function evidenceMatched(value:string){const normalized=(input:string)=>String(input||'').replace(/\s+/g,'');const evidence=normalized(value);return Boolean(evidence&&normalized(draft.value?.source_excerpt||'').includes(evidence))}
function statusName(v:string){return v==='published'?'已发布':v==='archived'?'已归档':'草稿'}
function reviewDecisionName(v:string){return ({pending:'待审核',approved:'通过',revision_required:'退回修改',rejected:'不采用'} as Record<string,string>)[v]||v}
function reviewIssueName(v:string){return reviewIssueOptions.find(x=>x.value===v)?.label||v}
async function load(){loading.value=true;try{const data=await api.list({q:q.value,question_type:type.value,status:status.value,page:page.value});items.value=data.items;total.value=data.total}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'加载失败')}finally{loading.value=false}}
async function loadReviewMetrics(){metricsLoading.value=true;try{reviewMetrics.value=await api.reviewMetrics()}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'教研反馈统计加载失败')}finally{metricsLoading.value=false}}
async function exportReviewDataset(){exportingDataset.value=true;try{const params={question_type:type.value||undefined,limit:1000};const dataset=await api.reviewDataset({...params,offset:0});const items=[...dataset.items];while(items.length<dataset.total_available){const next=await api.reviewDataset({...params,offset:items.length});if(!next.items.length)break;items.push(...next.items)}if(items.length<dataset.total_available)throw new Error('审核记录在导出期间发生变化，请稍后重新导出');const completeDataset={...dataset,count:items.length,items};const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(completeDataset,null,2)],{type:'application/json;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download=`shenlun-review-dataset-${type.value||'all'}-${localToday()}.json`;document.body.appendChild(link);link.click();link.remove();window.setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);ElMessage.success(`已导出 ${items.length} 条审核样本`)}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'审核样本导出失败')}finally{exportingDataset.value=false}}
async function loadJobs(){try{jobsList.value=await api.jobs()}catch(error){console.warn('加载申论生成任务失败',error)};const active=jobsList.value.some(x=>['pending','running'].includes(x.status));if(active&&!pollTimer.value)pollTimer.value=setInterval(()=>{loadJobs();load()},5000);if(!active&&pollTimer.value){clearInterval(pollTimer.value);pollTimer.value=null}}
function jobStatus(v:string){return ({pending:'排队中',running:'生成中',completed:'已完成',partial:'部分完成',failed:'失败'} as Record<string,string>)[v]||v}
async function generateDaily(){generating.value=true;try{await api.generate(generationDate.value);ElMessage.success('出题任务已提交，结果将进入草稿审核队列');await loadJobs()}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'任务提交失败')}finally{generating.value=false}}
function openVocabulary(){void router.push({name:'rmrb-vocabulary',query:{collect_date:generationDate.value}})}
function empty():api.ShenlunExercise{return {question_type:'summary',title:'',source_article_id:null,source_material_id:null,fact_material_summary:'',fact_material_limit:'',fact_training:{},source_title:'',source_url:'',source_date:'',source_excerpt:'',prompt:'',requirements:'',max_chars:200,hint:'',key_points:[],rubric:[],sample_answer:'',analysis:'',related_assets:[],difficulty:'基础',estimated_minutes:8,sort_order:0,is_featured:false,status:'draft',human_review:{decision:'pending',issue_tags:[],notes:'',corrections_made:false},human_review_history:[]}}
function edit(row?:api.ShenlunExercise){const current=row?JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(row)) as api.ShenlunExercise:empty();current.human_review ||= {decision:'pending',issue_tags:[],notes:'',corrections_made:false};current.human_review_history ||= [];current.fact_training ||= {};draft.value=current;pointsText.value=JSON.stringify(current.key_points,null,2);rubricText.value=JSON.stringify(current.rubric,null,2);assetsText.value=JSON.stringify(current.related_assets,null,2);factTrainingText.value=JSON.stringify(current.fact_training,null,2);editing.value=true}
function reviewDecisionChanged(value:string){if(draft.value&&['revision_required','rejected'].includes(value))draft.value.status='draft'}
function articleChanged(id:string|null){const a=articleList.value.find(x=>x.id===id);if(a&&draft.value){draft.value.source_material_id=null;draft.value.fact_material_summary='';draft.value.fact_material_limit='';draft.value.fact_training={};factTrainingText.value='{}';draft.value.source_title=a.title;draft.value.source_url=a.source_url;draft.value.source_date=a.publish_date}}
function questionTypeChanged(value:api.ExerciseType){if(value!=='essay'&&draft.value){draft.value.source_material_id=null;draft.value.fact_material_summary='';draft.value.fact_material_limit='';draft.value.fact_training={};factTrainingText.value='{}'}}
function factMaterialChanged(id:string|null){if(!draft.value)return;if(!id){draft.value.source_material_id=null;draft.value.fact_material_summary='';draft.value.fact_material_limit='';draft.value.fact_training={};factTrainingText.value='{}';return}const material=factMaterialList.value.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!material)return;draft.value.source_article_id=null;draft.value.source_material_id=material.id;draft.value.fact_material_summary=material.text;draft.value.fact_material_limit=material.do_not_use_for;draft.value.fact_training={};factTrainingText.value='{}';draft.value.source_title=material.source_title;draft.value.source_url=material.source_url;draft.value.source_date=material.source_date;draft.value.source_excerpt=material.source_evidence||material.source_anchor;draft.value.title ||= `事实论证练习｜${material.source_title}`}
async function generateTraining(){if(!draft.value?.source_material_id)return;generatingFactTraining.value=true;try{draft.value.fact_training=await api.generateFactTraining(draft.value.source_material_id);factTrainingText.value=JSON.stringify(draft.value.fact_training,null,2);draft.value.human_review={decision:'pending',issue_tags:[],notes:'',corrections_made:false};if(draft.value.status==='published')draft.value.status='draft';ElMessage.success('主题训练包已生成，请核验后保存')}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'训练包生成失败')}finally{generatingFactTraining.value=false}}
function refreshTrainingPreview(){if(!draft.value)return;try{draft.value.fact_training=JSON.parse(factTrainingText.value);ElMessage.success('预览已刷新')}catch{ElMessage.error('主题训练包 JSON 格式无效')}}
async function save(){const current=draft.value;if(!current)return;try{current.key_points=JSON.parse(pointsText.value);current.rubric=JSON.parse(rubricText.value);current.related_assets=JSON.parse(assetsText.value);current.fact_training=JSON.parse(factTrainingText.value)}catch{ElMessage.error('要点、评价维度、关联积累和主题训练包必须是有效 JSON');return}saving.value=true;try{await api.save(current);ElMessage.success('练习已保存');editing.value=false;load();loadReviewMetrics()}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e instanceof Error?e.message:'保存失败')}finally{saving.value=false}}
async function archiveRow(row:api.ShenlunExercise){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm('归档后学员端不可再进入该练习。','确认归档');await api.archive(row.id!);ElMessage.success('已归档');load()}catch(error){if(error!=='cancel'&&error!=='close')ElMessage.error(error instanceof Error?error.message:'归档失败')}}
onMounted(async()=>{try{articleList.value=await api.articles()}catch(error){console.warn('加载人民日报文章失败',error)};try{factMaterialList.value=await api.factMaterials()}catch(error){console.warn('加载已审核事实素材失败',error)};load();loadJobs();loadReviewMetrics()})
onUnmounted(()=>{if(pollTimer.value)clearInterval(pollTimer.value)})
</script>
<style scoped>
.page{padding:20px}.work-tabs{margin-top:14px}.work-tabs :deep(.el-tab-pane){padding-top:6px}.review-metrics{margin-top:0}.metrics-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:14px}.metrics-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0}.metrics-head h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:16px}.metrics-head p{margin:0;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px}.metrics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(90px,1fr));gap:10px}.metrics-grid>div{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color-lighter);border-radius:8px;background:var(--el-fill-color-lighter)}.metrics-grid span{display:block;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:12px}.metrics-grid b{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:22px;color:var(--el-text-color-primary)}.issue-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px}.version-table{margin-top:14px}@media(max-width:900px){.metrics-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(90px,1fr))}}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px}.head h2{margin:0 0 6px}.head p,.muted{color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.auto-panel{margin-top:0}.auto-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;margin-bottom:14px}.auto-head h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:16px}.auto-head p{margin:0;max-width:760px}.auto-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;flex-wrap:wrap}.empty-jobs{padding:14px;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px}.job-details{padding:4px 20px 12px;line-height:1.7}.job-detail-row{padding:3px 0;color:var(--el-text-color-regular);font-size:13px}.job-skip-title{display:block;margin-top:10px}.evidence-preview{margin:0 0 18px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);border-radius:8px;background:var(--el-fill-color-lighter)}.evidence-preview h4{margin:0 0 10px}.evidence-point{padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--el-border-color-lighter)}.evidence-point>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}.evidence-point blockquote{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:12px;border-left:3px solid var(--el-color-primary);color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.relation-reason{margin:7px 0 0;color:var(--el-text-color-regular);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.review-history-row{padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.fact-training-panel{margin:14px 0;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);border-radius:8px;background:var(--el-fill-color-lighter)}.fact-training-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:10px}.fact-training-head p,.fact-training-theme p,.fact-training-related p{margin:5px 0;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.fact-training-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0}.fact-training-theme,.fact-training-related{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--el-border-color-lighter)}.fact-training-theme blockquote{margin:8px 0;padding:10px 12px;border-left:3px solid var(--el-color-primary);background:var(--el-bg-color);line-height:1.7}.fact-training-citation,.fact-training-related span{font-size:12px;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary)}.filters{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.filters .el-input{width:260px}.filters .el-select{width:160px}.muted{margin-top:5px}.el-pagination{justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px}
</style>
